</div>

<div class="form-group">
    <ul class="list-group">
        <li class="list-group-item link-dark"><a href="/admin/movies/movies-directors/movies-directors-list">Режиссеры</a></li>
        <li class="list-group-item link-dark"><a href="/admin/movies/movies-genres/movies-genres-list">Жанры</a></li>
        <li class="list-group-item link-dark"><a href="/admin/movies/list-movies">Фильмы</a></li>
